  <title>SET DECIMALS Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>Decimals<keyword>setting number of places</keyword></keyword>
    <keyword>Displaying<keyword>numbers</keyword></keyword>
    <keyword>Environment</keyword>
    <keyword>SET DECIMALS command</keyword>
    <keyword>Setting<keyword>decimal places</keyword></keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET DECIMALS Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">更改用于确定数字显示小数位数的设置。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">SET DECIMALS TO [&lt;<text styleclass="Italic">nDecimals</text>&gt;]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List"><text styleclass="Italic">nDecimals</text>&#32;<tab />指定要显示的小数位数下限。最大值为 18 位，最小值为 0。若省略该值，则默认使用 0。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">说明</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">未指定值的 SET DECIMALS TO 等同于 SET DECIMALS TO 0。SET DECIMALS 在功能上等同于 SetDecimal()。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibRT" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetDecimal.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetDecimal()</link><text styleclass="Bold" style="font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; vertical-align:baseline; color:#000000; background-color:transparent; letter-spacing:normal; letter-scaling:100%;">、</text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetDecimalSep.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetDecimalSep()</link><text styleclass="Bold" style="font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; vertical-align:baseline; color:#000000; background-color:transparent; letter-spacing:normal; letter-scaling:100%;">、</text><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetFixed.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetFixed()</link><text styleclass="Bold" style="font-family:Arial; font-size:10pt; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; text-transform:none; vertical-align:baseline; color:#000000; background-color:transparent; letter-spacing:normal; letter-scaling:100%;">、</text></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"></para>
